<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-23T03:51:45.198Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 03:51:45 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits in Zamfara have declared no-go areas and imposed a N50 million levy on communities ahead of the 2027 elections, while gunmen have repeatedly set secondary schools ablaze in Plateau, including a Bokkos school. In Gombe, Air Force personnel allegedly opened fire on civilians, causing deaths and injuries, and in Benue military forces rescued two abducted women. ISWAP suffered a major loss with a Shura Council member and top commanders killed as troops repelled an attack in Borno. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQZG5kNWlmcEZkU1FwejJfVUlPR3hKT3NqSngzMXBncG01NjhoUl9xUGs5V19yWGs5WDFJaE9qV01tZTM3aVZpOE5FOEVLQ1lCbDRSX0VXU1F4aVFjTUdJT1UyV0hTOFZtTzNvVFI1cnFWdnJFNWJLZGlDakFUVW1ZWkxKUkNZYVhVSEN5dDc3WXlqaGs0Q3d2QzdUUmR6QzlCTDhIeWVGT2VyZHRHODFGQWl1R0lidw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxQd2I2VXZfT0VSYUhScFNpYXI5THROaUhNbkRlWEJ1UEZTWHROS0hkUDVJTzdCdWRhR2VtY3JhY0VNcWpVN2dQMEF2M3NrYnpwSkpxZ3dkd1R3aXlKTEFFVHNQQ0hXRlRHRmxUdm90LUZMVm4xUkExNkdnYkdmNmZJWUJGR0tsbkhONl9xVkRR?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Sun Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Express Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPTHB6dnV2Q1NrZE5lVEgtMVhWS2RkekZzNExVLWFHYVBMWEpxYnkxWXIxcTR2YV9LRkQ2Z295SGRaNldQblhVZGF5ekxNSTlweFo3WEtyT2VOZm5VUVBTY1B2bEtDVkRfQnVZVmFud3ZMZUFmbVN2elMxUGJBaVlXNjluMUg?oc=5&quot;&gt;LEADERSHIP Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxPbHo1N01WcWQweGxycVgxZkw1S2J1enZGNXBFaklyc3g2UE41cXpBRkg4UmZuaWtNUTQ0NWpkXzhteHNuVXJQWWZ4anlKRWROSFJxd2R2T0N2V1RXZmJRcUt6UW5wZFJHZEZCWktMY1AwMml3Q01VNk51c3BQbDVBM0hJbjNsR0MwQWJiM0RkR3I